Subject: [PATCH 35/40] Add opt-in GPU timestamps around render passes

Adds NBA2K14_GPU_TIMING=1: GPU timestamps around each render pass,
logged per pass size and in frame order, to rank what costs most.
---
 .../renderer_vulkan/vk_scheduler.cpp          | 128 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 128 insertions(+)

